# Module: RBAC & Permissions

## Scope

Permission catalog, roles, role-permission mapping, user-role assignment, scope resolution, permission caching.

## Key Entities

`Permission`, `Role`, `RolePermission`, `UserRole`, `PermissionScope`

## Permissions (meta — manage RBAC itself)

```
roles.create
roles.update
roles.delete
roles.permissions.assign
users.roles.assign
permissions.read
```

## Scope Types

```csharp
public enum ScopeType { Tenant, Branch, Class, Self }
```

- `Tenant` — full tenant access (admin)
- `Branch` — branch/campus scoped
- `Class` — class teacher scope
- `Self` — parent (linked children) / student (own record)

## Key Services

- `PermissionResolverService` — effective permissions for user (cached in Redis)
- `ScopeResolverService` — applies scope filter to queries
- `AuthorizationBehavior` — MediatR pipeline permission check

## Default System Roles (seeded, `IsSystem = true`)

`SuperAdmin`, `TenantAdmin`, `Teacher`, `Accountant`, `Parent`, `Student`

## Events

- `RolePermissionsChangedIntegrationEvent` → invalidate permission cache
- `UserRoleAssignedIntegrationEvent` → invalidate user permission cache

## Cache Keys

- `permissions:{tenantId}:{userId}` — TTL 15 minutes
- Invalidate on any role/permission change
